silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg_1_domesticcatrefinementlega silm:hasExample "In 'S03OlogNodeArrowLawYonedaHomLeg1', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, a:Mittens->DomesticCat — the domestic-cat refinement leg; admissible iff r.a equals c" .
